Doporuceni bere z luxos-hwdetect --json (viz /usr/lib/luxos/python/luxos_drivers.py),
instaluje pres pkexec a /usr/lib/luxos/drivers/luxos-drivers-helper (lux ve strojovem rezimu).
V live systemu jen ukazuje, co instalator nainstaluje.
"""
